      "text": "def F(a, b, t):\n    if a < b or len(t) > 5:\n        return 0\n    elif a == b and len(t) <= 5:\n        print(t)\n        return 1\n    else:\n        return F(a / 2, b, t+'1') + F(a-1, b, t+'2')\n\nF(65, 4, '')  \n\n# Ответ: 21111"
